        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The charts below show the percentage of students at an adult education centre taking various courses offered in 1985 and this year. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEoudtjjnoHwLOxhyXMlcwVOgkX\"><strong><em>The charts below show the percentage of students at an adult education centre taking various courses offered in 1985 and this year.</em></strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Di7id7xprouJUDxQ4etlGUpEgHf\"><strong><em>Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</em></strong></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Adult Education Courses: 1985 vs Now</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TqPldEHP5oO9Eqxr2kRlefpxgtb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K7podiVjgoU3MvxyMFalKA6dgKg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/task-1-pie-charts\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Giới thiệu dạng Pie Charts</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BCntd3oGAoSRR1xHXMkln43Lgud\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Adult Education Courses: 1985 vs Now y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả tỷ lệ học vi&ecirc;n tham gia c&aacute;c kh&oacute;a học tại một trung t&acirc;m gi&aacute;o dục trong 2 năm: 1985 v&agrave; hiện tại.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R3NXdh8vyohPWXx2310lp8uXgNg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong>&nbsp;</strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Np0Nd63YjoZ2LoxAKaKluXCPgQc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Adult Education Courses: 1985 vs Now với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: tỷ lệ học vi&ecirc;n - năm 1985 v&agrave; hiện tại.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OoT6dFoMRoo23Fx9HTPlKdnhgxg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Học c&aacute;ch viết Introduction</strong> cho <strong>tất cả</strong> c&aacute;c b&agrave;i dạng <strong>Pie Graphs</strong> ở đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute; &rarr; <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/intro-pie\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">C&aacute;ch viết Introduction dạng PIE</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IFf1dMjRDok8HtxlXSUlI37OgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PES6dseoLobP1kxm8GSljpAcgZe\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WnphdZRq0onIkCxzWmZl7GRlg4b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: </strong>Một số kh&oacute;a học vẫn giữ được độ phổ biến || một v&agrave;i kh&oacute;a học bị thay thế.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QoXvdYaN4osbt6xDNudlNj1egYb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>Modern Languages giảm độ phổ biến nhiều nhất || IT trở th&agrave;nh kh&oacute;a học phổ biến nhất</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZrvgdhtrQovJnNxqKVSl5FLhgxe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-APeudfcnGokeKfxzDvQl1ZTYg0b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZKeidNvRUomf1bx5BFDlwhvEgTf\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZKeidNvRUomf1bx5BFDlwhvEgTf\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ag5CdNVfXoWE9IxqVyIlRycXgSy\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Modern Languages, Fitness and Dance, Art, v&agrave; Cookery</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XYb4dZXsZoD1mnxLj3BlPL5Hgne\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F4GBdHNg2o60jexEGN2lDZ9qgLh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1985 </strong><em>(Modern Languages l&agrave; 24%, </em><em><strong>theo sau</strong></em><em> l&agrave; </em><em>Fitness and Dance ở mức 22%</em><em>, trong khi Art l&agrave; 17%, </em><em>v&agrave;</em><em> Cookery l&agrave; 14%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MwlAdgixdomMCcx93DelxYkvgNe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Modern Languages v&agrave; Fitness and Dance </strong><em>(Modern Languages </em><em><strong>giảm mạnh</strong></em><em> xuống 17%, Fitness and Dance </em><em><strong>duy tr&igrave;</strong></em><em>&nbsp;ở mức 22%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NMWwdVeCoo9gHvxPfOAlqbyvgsf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Art v&agrave; Cookery </strong><em>(Art </em><em><strong>giảm nhẹ</strong></em><em> xuống 15%, Cookery </em><em><strong>tăng</strong></em><em> l&ecirc;n 19%)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ejc6dy9xgoCTiZxU3D0ll8ggg4J\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CMAGdlHtOoSFpCx9IcOlPJTJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Anild0KgDodr4CxaGVxlsOo5g9g\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Local History, Music Appreciation, v&agrave; IT</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Anild0KgDodr4CxaGVxlsOo5g9g\">\n<div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Anild0KgDodr4CxaGVxlsOo5g9g\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J0kIdCCIeowO3oxVCq7lJ9Q6gVd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1)&nbsp;<strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Local History v&agrave; Music Appreciation</strong> <em>(cả 2 đều </em><em><strong>chiếm</strong></em><em> 23% v&agrave;o năm 1985, sau đ&oacute; th&igrave; kh&ocirc;ng c&ograve;n được dạy nữa)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IxbLdHLLioiXPVx4wRqlXTUBgpe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của IT</strong> <em>(được th&ecirc;m v&agrave;o sau n&agrave;y năm nay v&agrave; </em><em>trở n&ecirc;n phổ biến nhất</em><em>, </em><em>thu h&uacute;t</em><em> 27% số liệu học sinh) </em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MCTSdfVoroHeaZxLkfllocxrgic\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi muốn diễn đạt việc \"<strong>một v&agrave;i kh&oacute;a học kh&ocirc;ng c&ograve;n nữa</strong>\", m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng \"<strong>be</strong> <strong>discontinued</strong>\" hoặc \"<strong>be</strong> <strong>no longer offered</strong>\" để c&acirc;u văn của m&igrave;nh đa dạng hơn nh&eacute;.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MCTSdfVoroHeaZxLkfllocxrgic\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NMgHdDPqXojU4FxTc5olhh71gc9\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A9EOdzw81ozy8mxPRCCl7lH4g2f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\"Some courses <strong>have been discontinued</strong>.\"</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B4XEdCbXfojCiCxvWlWle7pjgcg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\"Local History and Music Appreciation <strong>were no longer offered</strong>\"</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 359,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PdhWdAgoQo3xd1xgmZdlma5TgoP\">The pie charts compare the proportions of students enrolled in different courses at an adult education centre between 1985 and the current year.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13776,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 360,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jooudif8GoYLevxoZjDlUDkQgYc\">Overall, while some courses have maintained their popularity over time, others have been discontinued and replaced with new options. In addition, Modern Languages experienced the most significant decline, while IT emerged as the most popular course in the current year.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13776,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 361,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CaCKdpEyVoGGvaxHolklGacfggd\">Looking at the courses that remained available throughout the period, Modern Languages attracted the highest percentage of students in 1985, at 24%, followed by Fitness and Dance with 22%. Art and Cookery were less popular, accounting for 17% and 14% of total enrollments respectively. By the current year, Modern Languages saw a substantial decrease to 17%, while Fitness and Dance maintained its share at 22%. Meanwhile, although Art's proportion slightly decreased to 15%, Cookery witnessed an increase to 19% of all students.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13776,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 362,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZVv4diZ2uoA95gxk3KPlrk7kgId\">Regarding other courses, Local History and Music Appreciation, which collectively made up 23% of enrollments in 1985, were no longer offered in the current year. Instead, a new IT course was introduced and quickly became the most popular option, drawing 27% of all students at the centre.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13776,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
